Laya multilingual checkpoint: https://huggingface.co/aac6fef/laya-multilingual-mlx
Revision f2b4faf51023039425946074e2cf1361d2db11d5, Apache License 2.0; an MLX FP16
conversion of https://huggingface.co/convaiinnovations/laya-multilingual
(revision 052592a15d198d9ad47da779604259b10b47b7aa, Apache License 2.0)

The checkpoint is not redistributed; the setup scripts download it from Hugging Face.
experiments/ptm45/typed-decisions.pt (ChipLaya weights release v1.0.0) holds fine-tuned values of
35M of its parameters (decision head, option scorer, type embedding, final norm and the last
four encoder layers), modified by src/chiplaya/finetune.py with the labels of
src/chipjev/decisions/finetune.py.

