mmBERT: https://huggingface.co/jhu-clsp/mmBERT-base
MIT License, as declared in its model card (read at revision
c5955035435e2bf121cde7f3c8863ef52ff35d82; the checkpoint's configuration names the encoder
without a revision)

The checkpoint's encoder is initialized from mmBERT-base (Marone, Weller, Fleshman, Yang,
Lawrie and Van Durme, 2025, arXiv:2509.06888), so the fine-tuned encoder layers in
experiments/ptm45/typed-decisions.pt derive from it. The license text and its provenance are
in LICENSES/MIT-mmBERT.txt.
